msgstr "同步發行版 (distro-sync)"

#: MainWindow.cpp:374
msgid "This will rebuild the RPM database using 'rpm --rebuilddb'. Continue?"
msgstr "這將使用 'rpm --rebuilddb' 重建 RPM 資料庫。繼續嗎？"

#: MainWindow.cpp:380
msgid "Repairing RPM database..."
msgstr "正在修復 RPM 資料庫..."

#: MainWindow.cpp:385
msgid ""
"This will remove unnecessary packages via 'dnf autoremove -y'. Continue?"
msgstr "這將透過 'dnf autoremove -y' 移除不必要的軟體套件。繼續嗎？"

#: MainWindow.cpp:391
msgid "Cleaning unused packages..."
